20243
ADDENDA <Act No. 20243, Feb. 6, 2024>
Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Act shall enter into force six months after the date of its promulgation; provided, the amended provisions of Appendices 471-2 and 471-3 shall enter into force on the date of their promulgation.
Article 2 (Applicability to requests for measures such as disciplinary action)
The amended provisions of Articles 12 (4) and 20 (4) shall begin to apply from the first case where a person having authority to take disciplinary action is requested by the Commission to take measures, such as disciplinary action, after this Act enters into force.
Article 3 (Applicability to standards for payment and calculation of monetary rewards)
The amended provisions of Articles 26 (2) and 26-2 shall begin to apply from the first whistleblowing made after this Act enters into force.
Article 4 (Applicability to request for provision of data for subrogation of right to claim damages)
The amended provisions of Article 27-2 shall also apply to cases where the right to claim damages is subrogated by subrogation due to relief funds paid before this Act enters into force.

